Edmond Montague "Eddy" Grant (lair 5 Maret 1948) ya iku musisi saka &lt;a href="Guyanese%20in%20the%20United%20Kingdom"&gt;Guyanese British&lt;/a&gt;. Dhéwéknè salahsijinè anggota sing ngedheknè &lt;a href="The%20Equals"&gt;The Equals&lt;/a&gt;, salahsijinè kelompok pop rasial sing diintregasi &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;. Dhéwéknè uga suksés ndhik karir solo teko tembang sing ènthuk platinum, ya iku &lt;a href="Electric%20Avenue%20%28song%29"&gt;"Electric Avenue"&lt;/a&gt;. Dhéwéknè uga sing melopori genre &lt;a href="ringbang"&gt;ringbang&lt;/a&gt;.
Grant lair ndhik &lt;a href="Plaisance%2C%20Guyana"&gt;Plaisance&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="British%20Guiana"&gt;British Guiana&lt;/a&gt;, sakbaré kui pindah ana ing &lt;a href="Linden%2C%20Guyana"&gt;Linden&lt;/a&gt;. Bapaké, Patrick, ya iku juru main terompèt sing main ndhik &lt;a href="Nello"&gt;Nello&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Luckies"&gt;Luckies&lt;/a&gt;. Wektu Grant ndhik sekolahan, wongtuwané tinggal lan kerjo ndhik &lt;a href="The%20United%20Kingdom"&gt;The United Kingdom&lt;/a&gt;, lan ngirim duit kanggo pendidikané. Ndèk taun, Grant pindah lan mèlu wongtuwané ndhik &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèkné tinggal ndhik &lt;a href="Kentish%20Town"&gt;Kentish Town&lt;/a&gt; lan luga sekolah ana ing Acland Burghley Secondary Modern ndhik &lt;a href="Tufnell%20Park"&gt;Tufnell Park&lt;/a&gt; kanggo sinau maca lan nulis musik. Dhèwèné dadi penggemaré &lt;a href="Chuck%20Berry"&gt;Chuck Berry&lt;/a&gt;, lan sabanjuré nonton mainé ndhik Finsbury Park Astoria, Grant mutisné arep terjun ndhik musik.
