<doc id="132661" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=132661" title="Marvel Studios">
Marvel Studios

Marvel Studios, LLC uga kawentar kanthi jeneng Marvel Films saka taun 1993 tekan taun 1996, ya iku studhio gambar lumaku saka Amèrikah dhedhasar The Walt Disney Studios ing Burbank, California. Wiwit taun 2015, Studhio marvèl dadi cabangé The Walt Disney Studios, sekabèhané iku dadi divisiné &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;The Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt;, lan prodhuser filem Kevin Feige minangka prèsidèné.
Studhio marvel duwèni cabang kalebu  Marvel Music, Marvel Film Productions LLC, MVL Development LLC, MVL Productions LLC, MVL Film Finance LLC, MVL Rights, LLC, Iron Works Productions LLC, Incredible Production and Asgard Productions LLC. Studhio iki mèlu ngembangaké telung karakter filem waralaba Marvèl kang ngasilaké  semiliar dolar ing Amèrikah lor,ya iku filem: the X-Men, Spider-Man, lan Marvel Cinematic Universe waralaba multi filem, karo X-Men lan Spider-Man bagi lisènsi karo &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Fox"&gt;20th Century Fox&lt;/a&gt; lan Sony Pictures, mungguh. Film Studhio Marvel  iku di dhistribusiké déning Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures; Paramount Pictures saka taun 2008 tekan taun 2011; taun 2008 Universal Pictures  The Incredible Hulk; lan &lt;a href="Columbia%20Pictures"&gt;Columbia Pictures&lt;/a&gt; kanggo Spider-Man: Homecoming kang dijadwalké digebyakaké tanggal 7 Juli 2017.
