Ras Muhamad ya iku musisi reggae saka &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Jenengé kuwi saka gabungan jeneng asliné &lt;a href="Muhamad"&gt;Muhamad&lt;/a&gt; lan jeneng &lt;a href="Ras"&gt;Ras&lt;/a&gt; sing dijupuk teko basa &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt; sing duwé arti Bung. Nanging onok ndhik basa &lt;a href="Ethiopia"&gt;Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt; uga sing artinè &lt;a href="Prince"&gt;Prince&lt;/a&gt;. Bapakè Ras Muhamad kui dokter akupuntur lan ibune iku &lt;a href="PNS"&gt;PNS&lt;/a&gt;. Arekè ndhik &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; wektu &lt;a href="SD"&gt;SD&lt;/a&gt; amarga sakbare kui arekè lunga menyang &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; mèlok ibuné sing ditugasno ndhik kono. Ras Muhamad mulih ana ing &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; baré ngrampungké &lt;a href="D3"&gt;D3&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwit taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt; arekè wiwit nggimbal rambuté.
Ngomongné bab musiké Ras Muhamad, &lt;a href="Bens%20Leno"&gt;Bens Leno&lt;/a&gt; pengamat musik ndhik Indonesia tau ngomong pilihané musik Ras Muhamad iku genrené &lt;a href="Reggae"&gt;Reggae&lt;/a&gt; lan sub-genrené &lt;a href="Dancehall"&gt;Dancehall&lt;/a&gt; nuntut uwong sing duwé kapekaan karo lingkungan sosial. Kasuksesané wes lekas bisa didelok wektu tour ana ing &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt; karo ana ing &lt;a href="Belanda"&gt;Belanda&lt;/a&gt;.
Tahun &lt;a href="2016"&gt;2016&lt;/a&gt; iki, tepaté ndhik bulan Juni, Ras diundang lan ngisi acara &lt;a href="festival%20reggae"&gt;festival reggae&lt;/a&gt; ndhik &lt;a href="Sierra%20Nevada%20World%20Music%20Festival"&gt;Sierra Nevada World Music Festival&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mendocino%20County%20Fairgrounds"&gt;Mendocino County Fairgrounds&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Boonville"&gt;Boonville&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;. Ras bakalan sak panggung karo &lt;a href="Jimmy%20Cliff"&gt;Jimmy Cliff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alpha%20Blondy"&gt;Alpha Blondy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Toots%20%26amp%3B%20The%20Maytals"&gt;Toots &amp; The Maytals&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lee%20%E2%80%9CScratch%E2%80%9D%20Perry"&gt;Lee “Scratch” Perry&lt;/a&gt;, lan artis-artis &lt;a href="reggae"&gt;reggae&lt;/a&gt; sing saiki wiwit nduwé jeneng, kayak &lt;a href="Fortunate%20Youth"&gt;Fortunate Youth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sara%20Lugo"&gt;Sara Lugo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabaka%20Pyramid"&gt;Kabaka Pyramid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mellow%20Mood"&gt;Mellow Mood&lt;/a&gt;, lan liyo-liyané.
