<doc id="132790" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=132790" title="Rocksteady">
Rocksteady

Rocksteady kui genre musik teko &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt; sing lair sekitaré taun &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;. Musik kui dadi penggantiné &lt;a href="Ska"&gt;Ska&lt;/a&gt; lan sing melopori &lt;a href="Reggae"&gt;Reggae&lt;/a&gt;. Rocksteady dikenalké karo musisi &lt;a href="jamaika"&gt;jamaika&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku &lt;a href="The%20Gaylads"&gt;The Gaylads&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Maytals"&gt;The Maytals&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="The%20Paragons"&gt;The Paragons&lt;/a&gt;. Istilah kui metu teko gaya jogèd sing onok ndhik laguné &lt;a href="Alton%20Ellis"&gt;Alton Ellis&lt;/a&gt;. Tariané ora luwih ènergik teko &lt;a href="Ska"&gt;Ska&lt;/a&gt;. Hit sepisané ya iku Hold Me Tight (No. 5 ndhik Inggris lan AS) sing ditembangné karo “Johnny Nash” (1968). Rocksteady ora mung nurunké tempo nanging uga mindah penenkanan alat sebul menyang &lt;a href="gitar"&gt;gitar&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="vokal"&gt;vokal&lt;/a&gt;. Ciriné iku iso didelok ndè laguné &lt;a href="Delroy%20Wilson"&gt;Delroy Wilson&lt;/a&gt; sing judhulé &lt;a href="Dancing%20Mood"&gt;Dancing Mood&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Gaylads"&gt;The Gaylads&lt;/a&gt; sing judhulé &lt;a href="Stop%20Making%20Love"&gt;Stop Making Love&lt;/a&gt;, lan temtuné &lt;a href="Desmond%20Dekker"&gt;Desmond Dekker&lt;/a&gt; sing judhulé &lt;a href="Israelites"&gt;Israelites&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="007%20%28Shanty%20Town%29"&gt;007 (Shanty Town)&lt;/a&gt;.
