<doc id="132927" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=132927" title="Anthony B">
Anthony B

Anthony B iku jeneng sing kawentaré Keith Anthony Blair utawa Keith Blair. Piyambaké lair ndhik &lt;a href="Clarks%20Town"&gt;Clarks Town&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt;. Penyanyi reggae Jamaika sing nduwé situs pribadi &lt;a href="www.anthonybmusic.net"&gt;www.anthonybmusic.net&lt;/a&gt; iku lair tanggal 31 Maret 1976. Gaya musiké ya iku &lt;a href="Dancehall"&gt;Dancehall&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ragga"&gt;Ragga&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Political%20Reggae"&gt;Political Reggae&lt;/a&gt;. Penyanyi sing gedhé ndhik &lt;a href="Paroki"&gt;Paroki&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Trelawny"&gt;Trelawny&lt;/a&gt; iki remen karo &lt;a href="Bob%20Marley"&gt;Bob Marley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Peter%20Tosh"&gt;Peter Tosh&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Bunny%20Wailer"&gt;Bunny Wailer&lt;/a&gt;. Gaya musiké Anthony B akèh kena prabawa teka telu musisi iku. Taun 1998, piyambaké kekancan karo seniman reggae kaya ta &lt;a href="Determine"&gt;Determine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mega%20Banton"&gt;Mega Banton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ricky%20General"&gt;Ricky General&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Terror%20Fabulous"&gt;Terror Fabulous&lt;/a&gt;. Anthony B uga salahsijiné anggota obahan saka &lt;a href="Bobo%20Ashanti"&gt;Bobo Ashanti&lt;/a&gt;, cabang saka obahané &lt;a href="Rastafarian"&gt;Rastafarian&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambaké ngerilis album sing kasil ya iku &lt;a href="Real%20Revolutionary"&gt;Real Revolutionary&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Universal%20Struggle"&gt;Universal Struggle&lt;/a&gt;. Bulan &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt; piyambaké ngerilis album karo &lt;a href="Greensleeves%20Records"&gt;Greensleeves Records&lt;/a&gt;.
