Buju Banton

Buju Banton lair tanggal 15 &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; 1973 ndhik &lt;a href="Kingston"&gt;Kingston&lt;/a&gt;, Jamaika. Jeneng lairé ya iku Mark Anthony Myrie. Penyanyi sing jinis musiké reggae elektronik iki biyasa nganggo gaya &lt;a href="Club"&gt;Club&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dancehall"&gt;Dancehall&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Roots%20Reggae"&gt;Roots Reggae&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raggae%20Pop"&gt;Raggae Pop&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Contemporary%20Reggae"&gt;Contemporary Reggae&lt;/a&gt;. Penyanyi &lt;a href="jamaika"&gt;jamaika&lt;/a&gt; iki tahu gawé lagu sing judhulé &lt;a href="Boom%20Bay%20Bay"&gt;Boom Bay Bay&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi kontrovèrsi.
Taun 2009, Buju Banton ngetokaké album sing irah-irahané &lt;a href="Rasta%20Got%20Soul"&gt;Rasta Got Soul&lt;/a&gt;.
Ndèk taun 2010 Buju Banton kena ukuman 10 taun nèng bui amarga kebukti nggawa 5 kilogram kokain. Nanging katetepan bab Buju isih gojag-gajeg.
Taun 2011, Buju Banton menangné &lt;a href="Grammy%20Award"&gt;Grammy Award&lt;/a&gt; ndhik kategori album reggae sing judhul albumé ya iku &lt;a href="Before%20The%20Dawn"&gt;Before The Dawn&lt;/a&gt;.
