<doc id="132972" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=132972" title="Mats Hummels">
Mats Hummels

Mats Hummels iku juru main bal-balan &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; sing nduwé jeneng dawa Mats Julian Hummels. Piyambaké lair tanggal 16 &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; 1988 ndhik &lt;a href="Bensberg"&gt;Bensberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Pemain sing duwuré 192&amp;nbsp;cm iki posisiné dadi juru main mburi. Taun 2007 piyambaké dadi juru main &lt;a href="Bayern%20Munchen"&gt;Bayern Munchen&lt;/a&gt;, sadurungé mung ana tim Bayern Munchen B. Nanging taun 2009 nganti 2016 piyambaké mbéla tim &lt;a href="Borussia%20Dortmund"&gt;Borussia Dortmund&lt;/a&gt;. Akiré piyambaké mbalek manèh ndhik Bayern Munchen tengah-tengahé taun 2016 iki. Sakdawané 8 taun ndhik &lt;a href="Signal%20Iduna%20Park"&gt;Signal Iduna Park&lt;/a&gt;, kandangé &lt;a href="Dortmund"&gt;Dortmund&lt;/a&gt;, Hummels wis main ping 307 tetandhingan lan gawé 25 gol.
Mangsa 2016 iki, Hummels bakal dadi juru main mburiné Bayern Munchen karo &lt;a href="J%C3%A9r%C3%B4me%20Boateng"&gt;Jérôme Boateng&lt;/a&gt;. Pertahanané Bayern mangsa iki bakal kuat amarga loro-loroné tahu main barengan ndhik tim bal-balan &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Sawise telung musim pindhah menyang Bayern Munchen, Hummels ing musim iki ditransfer bali manèh déning klubé sakawit yaiku &lt;a href="Borussia%20Dortmund"&gt;Borussia Dortmund&lt;/a&gt;.
