<doc id="133039" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=133039" title="Rohan Marley">
Rohan Marley

Rohan Marley iku juru main bal-balan(American Football) profèsional lan penyanyi reggae sing lair ndhik &lt;a href="Kingston"&gt;Kingston&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt; tanggal 19 &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; 1972. Dhèwèkné nduwé lima anak karo &lt;a href="Lauryn%20Hill"&gt;Lauryn Hill&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng anak-anaké ya iku &lt;a href="Zion%20David%20Marley"&gt;Zion David Marley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Selah%20Louise%20Marley"&gt;Selah Louise Marley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Joshua%20Omaru%20Marley"&gt;Joshua Omaru Marley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="John%20Nesta%20Marley"&gt;John Nesta Marley&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sarah%20Marley"&gt;Sarah Marley&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging sakduré kuwi dhèwèkné tau rabi karo &lt;a href="Geraldine%20Khawly"&gt;Geraldine Khawly&lt;/a&gt; wektu ndhik universitas. Anak saka &lt;a href="Bob%20Marley"&gt;Bob Marley&lt;/a&gt; lan bojoné &lt;a href="Janet%20Hunt"&gt;Janet Hunt&lt;/a&gt; iki ya iku penyanyi lan pebisnis sanadyan ndisik tau dadi juru main bal-balan &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Bapakné séda wektu Rohan isih umur 9 taun.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Saliyané dadi penayanyi lan juru main bal-balan, Rohan uga nduwé perusahaan klambi &lt;a href="Tuff%20Gong%20WorldWide"&gt;Tuff Gong WorldWide&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jammin%20Java%20Corp"&gt;Jammin Java Corp&lt;/a&gt; (Sadurungé taun 2011).
Rohan wiwit bal-balan wektu pindah ana ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; lan main ndhik &lt;a href="SMA"&gt;SMA&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Miami%20Palmetto"&gt;Miami Palmetto&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Perguruan%20Tinggi"&gt;Perguruan Tinggi&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèkné main ndhik posisi glandhang wektu ndhik &lt;a href="University%20of%20Miami"&gt;University of Miami&lt;/a&gt; taun 1992. Kanca-kancané wektu dadi juru main bal-balan ndhik universitas ya iku &lt;a href="Dwayne%20Johnson"&gt;Dwayne Johnson&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ray%20Lewis"&gt;Ray Lewis&lt;/a&gt;.
Sakbanjuré dhèwèkné main kanthi profésional mung beberapa taun waé. Nanging sakbaré kuwi dhèwèkné fokus ana ing bisnis dan dadi uwong sing ngedhekné &lt;a href="Marley%20Coffee"&gt;Marley Coffee&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèkné uga main ndhik filem dokumenter sing sesirahé &lt;a href="Motherland"&gt;Motherland&lt;/a&gt;.
